     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "出身、求學與律師生涯",
      "en": "Origins, studies and legal career"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "哈布1865年8月8日生於韋登斯維爾（Wädenswil），父親羅伯特是商人，母親名伊莉莎白，娘家姓施塔姆。他在蘇黎世、斯特拉斯堡和萊比錫研讀法學，1888年取得博士學位；1889年在韋登斯維爾開設律師事務所，經營到1899年，同年被選為蘇黎世高等法院法官。",
      "en": "Robert Haab was born on 8 August 1865 in Wädenswil, the son of Robert, a merchant, and Elisabeth, née Stamm. He studied law in Zurich, Strasbourg and Leipzig, taking his doctorate in 1888. In 1889 he opened a law office in Wädenswil, which he ran until 1899, the year he was elected a judge of the Zurich High Court."
     },
