     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "市議會、州議會與蘇黎世州政府",
      "en": "Municipal council, cantonal parliament and Zurich cantonal government"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1892年他以自由派（Freisinniger）身分進入韋登斯維爾市議會，1894至1899年任市議會主席；1894年當選蘇黎世州議會議員，任期到1902年，1906至1908年再度任職。1908年當選州政府委員（Regierungsrat），起初主管司法、警察與軍事，後來改管建設。1911年聯邦委員會請他接任瑞士聯邦鐵路總局的職位，他接受選任後，1912年辭去州政府職務。",
      "en": "In 1892 Haab entered the Wädenswil municipal council as a Freisinniger (Radical-Liberal), serving as its president from 1894 to 1899. He was elected to the Zurich cantonal parliament in 1894, sat there until 1902 and again from 1906 to 1908. In 1908 he was elected to the cantonal government (Regierungsrat), first heading justice, police and military affairs, then the building department. In 1911 the Federal Council offered him the general directorship of the Swiss Federal Railways; accepting the election meant that he resigned from the cantonal government in 1912."
     },
