     "periodEndPrecision": "year",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "駐德公使與聯邦委員會（1917–1929）",
      "en": "Envoy to Berlin and member of the Federal Council (1917-1929)"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1917年他擔任瑞士駐德意志帝國的柏林公使，同年12月13日在第一輪投票中以163票當選聯邦委員會（Bundesrat）委員，並在1922年與1929年出任聯邦主席（Bundespräsident）。整個任期內他主管郵政與鐵路部，持續推動瑞士聯邦鐵路電氣化，並把郵政、電話與電報行政經營成模範事業。他於1929年卸任。",
      "en": "In 1917 Haab served as Swiss envoy to the German Reich in Berlin, and on 13 December 1917 he was elected to the Federal Council (Bundesrat) in the first ballot with 163 votes; he was Federal President in 1922 and 1929. Throughout his term he headed the Post and Railway Department, kept promoting the electrification of the Swiss Federal Railways, and developed the post, telephone and telegraph administration into model enterprises. He resigned in 1929."
     },
