     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "卸任後的公益職務與去世",
      "en": "Public-interest roles after 1929 and death"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1929年卸任後，哈布在蘇黎世投入公益與文化事務，曾任戈特弗里德·凱勒學會（Gottfried Keller-Gesellschaft）主席。1933年獲蘇黎世大學授予經濟學名譽博士，1934年接任瑞士人民銀行（Volksbank）主席。他1939年10月15日在蘇黎世去世；傳記辭典稱他是與民眾關係密切、個性堅強的人物。",
      "en": "After his resignation in 1929 Haab devoted himself in Zurich to public-interest and cultural matters, among other things as president of the Gottfried Keller Society. In 1933 the University of Zurich awarded him an honorary doctorate in economics, and in 1934 he took over the presidency of the Swiss Volksbank. He died in Zurich on 15 October 1939; the dictionary calls him a strong personality close to the people."
     },
