     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "制憲議會時期",
      "en": "Constituent Assembly period"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "愛沙尼亞議會（Riigikogu）官網說，制憲議會（Asutav Kogu）選舉在1919年4月5日至7日舉行，議員中有許多後來的國家政治人物，其中包括恩帕盧、雅克松與庫克。制憲議會1919年4月23日在塔林首次集會，運作到1920年12月20日，I Riigikogu於當日就任。",
      "en": "The Riigikogu website says the Constituent Assembly (Asutav Kogu) was elected from 5 to 7 April 1919 and that its members included many later statesmen, among them Kaarel Eenpalu, Jüri Jaakson and Juhan Kukk. The Assembly first met in Tallinn on 23 April 1919 and operated until 20 December 1920, when the first Riigikogu took office."
     },
